  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"3 x plus 21 equals 3 x plus k\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>21</mn></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">In the given equation, <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> is a constant. The equation has infinitely many solutions. What is the value of <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
